cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TrendCite in your work, please cite it as below."
title: TrendCite
abstract: >-
  Evidence-first trend intelligence for founders: a local, read-only CLI that
  turns public Hacker News, GitHub, RSS/Atom and Reddit signals into 3 to 5
  content opportunity briefs, each traceable to source URLs, captured metrics
  and a deterministic score breakdown.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abaco3300/trendcite"
url: "https://github.com/Abaco3300/trendcite"
keywords:
  - trends
  - evidence
  - content-strategy
  - hacker-news
  - rss
  - github
  - cli
authors:
